"""Draw 'The World in One Day' — Thursday 19 November 2026.

A one-page newspaper front page: 36 stories (13 illustrated + 23 briefs),
continent bar, KPI strip, world map, date-check box, plus a gradient paper
background with a masthead band and a GOOD NEWS TODAY band (3 positive
stories drawn from the 36). Flat PIL shapes only; no text inside the art
strips. Deterministic: same bytes every run. Writes entry.png (1024x1024)
beside this file.
"""
